{"2976860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BABA YAGA: Whispers of the BOOM", "steam_appid": 2976860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5088840], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/39a93a4c472600af5ff880e5f5734a26.avif?t=1787324422\" width=800 height=255 /></span><strong>Harness the power of magical glyphs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/a5398a9d473756e892c8a8a796f6e48d.poster.avif?t=1787324422\" width=1170 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/a5398a9d473756e892c8a8a796f6e48d.webm?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/a5398a9d473756e892c8a8a796f6e48d.mp4?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Place explosive glyphs on Moon Shards to destroy enemies, shatter obstacles, and open new paths. Gather <strong>minerals</strong> and mysterious <strong>ingredients</strong> to forge powerful <strong>runes</strong> that enhance your abilities and change the way you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master timing, positioning, and strategy to survive increasingly dangerous encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/f9c66a6243a465d467b2a91c0a77d7fc.avif?t=1787324422\" width=800 height=255 /></span><strong>A living forest shaped by Slavic myths</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/e095d47804051b9bd675e2a330d24fda.poster.avif?t=1787324422\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/e095d47804051b9bd675e2a330d24fda.webm?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/e095d47804051b9bd675e2a330d24fda.mp4?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enter a mysterious forest inspired by <strong>Slavic</strong> mythology - a place that breathes and feels. Twisted <strong>fractal trees</strong> reach toward the sky, and something unsettling moves across the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is the domain of <strong>Leshy</strong> - the ancient ruler of the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The forest lives and reacts to your presence, hiding secrets and awakening horrors as you venture deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And in the shadows, someone is always watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/e3aeb738d0b338db11354137d533e6c6.avif?t=1787324422\" width=800 height=255 /></span><strong>Time flows with the rhythm of the Moon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/6fed6b00f9cb424bb15f031adbd86e13.poster.avif?t=1787324422\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/6fed6b00f9cb424bb15f031adbd86e13.webm?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/6fed6b00f9cb424bb15f031adbd86e13.mp4?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect <strong>Moon Shards</strong> scattered across the forest to rebuild the Moon and progress through its phases. With each phase, the world transforms - wolves howl, crimson light floods the woods, and the dead begin to rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>Full Moon</strong> is the ultimate moment - powerful, dangerous, and always tied to an unforgettable event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/deb75d5dc34862eeeabcf08a304ef6e2.avif?t=1787324422\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/ecbb19be19dad11a740316ed66230cb6.avif?t=1787324422\" width=1560 height=934 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The forest is ruled by powerful entities drawn from <strong>Slavic</strong> mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encounter witches, spirits, and guardians whose actions shape the fate of the world. Face terrifying beings such as <strong>The</strong> <strong>Nightmare</strong> - a wraith capable of raising the dead - or confront fire-born emissaries and nature-bound guardians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Some</strong> will test you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Some</strong> may help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>All</strong> leave their mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/e618e6e1021bd0dbd0eb7a23252933c4.avif?t=1787324422\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/8dc0e15d447cfb0ac86e3456427c59bc.avif?t=1787324422\" width=850 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You were taken long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kidnapped by <strong>Baba Yaga</strong> and trapped within her domain, your past was stolen and your future rewritten. Now, guided by fragments of memory and accompanied by a sarcastic rabbit named <strong>Bunny</strong>, you return to face what waits in the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Revenge</strong> drives you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Love</strong> pulls you deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And somewhere in the shadows…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Baba Yaga is <strong>waiting</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><strong>CRAFT AND SHAPE YOUR POWER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/e0f0ef1d9fd02c9c7b4a28d12ca72a96.avif?t=1787324422\" width=1560 height=934 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather <strong>minerals</strong> and mysterious <strong>ingredients</strong> hidden throughout the forest. Forge powerful mixtures that enhance your <strong>abilities</strong> and change the way you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment with different combinations to unlock new effects, strengthen your <strong>glyphs</strong>, and adapt to the dangers that await deeper in the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/09fad3bcb3f1705024f9d004b0f118af.poster.avif?t=1787324422\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/09fad3bcb3f1705024f9d004b0f118af.webm?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/09fad3bcb3f1705024f9d004b0f118af.mp4?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared