 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/e0f0ef1d9fd02c9c7b4a28d12ca72a96.avif?t=1787324422\" width=1560 height=934 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather <strong>minerals</strong> and mysterious <strong>ingredients</strong> hidden throughout the forest. Forge powerful mixtures that enhance your <strong>abilities</strong> and change the way you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment with different combinations to unlock new effects, strengthen your <strong>glyphs</strong>, and adapt to the dangers that await deeper in the woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/09fad3bcb3f1705024f9d004b0f118af.poster.avif?t=1787324422\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/09fad3bcb3f1705024f9d004b0f118af.webm?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976860/extras/09fad3bcb3f1705024f9d004b0f118af.mp4?t=1787324422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Top-down action adventure: Enter a surreal forest shaped by Slavic myths, where the Moon rules time and the dead rise. Collect Moon Shards, craft runes, and survive explosive battles against horrors lurking among fractal trees. One, two, three... Baba Yaga is watching you!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s